thread:
  label: The thread
  heading: Magick, engineered.
  text: |-
    Art, music, poetry, ceremony and coaching look like separate things. For me they're one practice: making things that help people feel more coherent, more alive, and more like themselves.

    I'm an engineer and an artist. I build rituals the way I build anything, with care for how every part meets the people inside it.
